  "body": "We have reports that enabling room retention in a very large room (with frequent joins and leaves) actually causes the size of the state tables to *increase*, which is surprising. \r\n\r\nNote that it appears that postgres is vacuuming the tables.\r\n\r\nAlso note that this is an experimental feature.",
